  <description>
    <p>
      Altisidora is a native Linux music player built with C++20 and Qt 6,
      focused on a fast local library and a clean desktop experience.
    </p>
    <p>
      It scans a music library, reads tags and embedded artwork, and plays
      audio through libmpv.
    </p>
